3. **Phase 3 - Anonymous Voting**: All parties (including you via AgentScope Studio) vote on the best reasoning
4. **Phase 4 - Weights & Scoring**: Vote winner gets bonus weight; final score is calculated
5. **Phase 5 - Final Report**: Chief Justice generates a comprehensive evaluation report

**Note**: When prompted for voting, please use AgentScope Studio to cast your vote.
    """)
    
    with gr.Row():
